{
  "slug": "prontonlp-plugin",
  "name": "Prontonlp Plugin",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "The ProntoNLP Plugin is an advanced financial analysis toolkit designed to transform complex financial data and earnings calls into structured, actionable intelligence. Powered by ProntoNLP data, the plugin enables investors, analysts, and researchers to generate comprehensive analytical reports on individual companies, broad market sectors, overarching market movements, or specific thematic topics—tracking sentiment trends, investment scores, and critical market narratives with ease.\n\nKey Features\n\nCompany Intelligence (pronto-company-intelligence): Conduct deep dives into specific companies. Track quarter-over-quarter shifts in management and analyst sentiment, benchmark stock performance, and identify predictive investment scores.\n\nSector & Industry Intelligence (pronto-sector-intelligence): Analyze entire industries simultaneously to rank companies, spot divergence signals (e.g., high sentiment + weak stock = potential buy), and identify dominant macroeconomic themes.\n\nComparative Analysis (pronto-compare): Compare anywhere from 2 to 5 companies or sectors head-to-head. Generate a unified side-by-side scoring across risk, sentiment, and performance dimensions to find the absolute leader.\n\nMarket Pulse Dashboard (pronto-marketpulse): Get a fundamentals-driven view of broad market activity. Track the biggest sentiment shifts, top movers, and most bullish companies across custom timeframes.\n\nThematic Topic Research (pronto-topic-research): Execute qualitative keyword research across thousands of financial documents. Synthesize trends, related sectors, and verbatim executive quotes into a structured narrative HTML report.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**, **4 agents** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `pronto-company-intelligence` (Generates a full intelligence report for a single named company or ticker — covering earnings sentiment, investment score,…), `pronto-compare` (Generates a unified side-by-side comparison report for two or more named companies, tickers, market sectors, or any mix…), `pronto-live-feed` (Generates a Claude live artifact showing the ProntoNLP live feed — Top Movers ordered by sentiment score change,…), `pronto-marketpulse` (Generates a broad market intelligence dashboard ranking companies across the entire market by investment score, sentiment shifts, and…), `pronto-sector-intelligence` (Generates a sector-level intelligence report analyzing all companies within an industry — ranking them by investment score and…), `pronto-topic-research` (Performs qualitative topic-based research across the market — how a keyword or theme shows up across documents)\n- **Agents** (4): `pronto-html-renderer` (Deterministic HTML report renderer for the regular ProntoNLP HTML skills), `pronto-live-artifact` (Shared live artifact builder for all ProntoNLP live artifact types), `pronto-search-summarizer` (Self-contained specialist agent that performs targeted, strategic calls to the ProntoNLP MCP search tool), `pronto-themes-broker` (Themes synthesis broker)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `prontonlp-mcp-server`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install prontonlp-plugin@claude-community` from `ProntoNLP/ProntoNLP-Plugin`.",
